    stem: "A client who sustained blunt anterior chest trauma in a vehicular collision has blood pressure of 84/66 mmHg, heart rate of 126 beats/min, marked jugular venous distention while seated upright, and distant, muffled heart sounds upon auscultation. Systolic blood pressure drops by 18 mmHg during quiet inspiration. Which life-threatening condition does the nurse identify?",
